'''Hiroshi Uratane''' (Japanese: '''ウラターヌ{{ruby|博士|ひろし}}''' ''Uratane Hiroshi'') is a main character in [[Let's Play the Pokémon Card Game XY!]]. He is a Pokémon Card Game Secret Trick researcher.

On the back of his lab coat, the "裏" kanji is written which is the term used to refer to tails on a coin in the Japanese version of the Pokemon TCG.

